Package: nexusos-defaults
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: zsh
Suggests: zsh-autosuggestions, zsh-syntax-highlighting
Description: NexusOS Engineering Edition shell defaults
 Default shell environment for NexusOS:
 .
  * a default ~/.zshrc template in /usr/share/nexusos/skel (the NexusOS
    image copies it to /etc/skel; packages never touch home directories)
  * shared aliases for bash and zsh and the NexusOS zsh prompt in
    /usr/share/nexusos/shell
 .
 The login shell of existing accounts is not changed.
